MMV: Music Muddervision        NannyMUD Times                        Page 10

  Some fellow mudders suggested making a list with all the guilds in 
  Nanny and associating a music theme. Since Nanny is inspired from the 
  J.R.R. Tolkien universe, I thought that it will be cool selecting 
  from the Lord of the rings soundtrack 14 songs and associating them 
  to the corresponding guild. Hope that it is accurate :

    Adventurers:  Howard Shore - The breaking of the fellowship
    Chefs:        Howard Shore - Concerning hobbits
    Cthulhu:      Howard Shore - The black gate is closed
    Darks :       Howard Shore - A journey in the dark
    Druids:       Howard Shore - Into the west
    Khorne:       Howard Shore - The bridge of khazad dum
    Knights:      Howard Shore - The king of the golden hall
    Lepers:       Howard Shore - Twilight and shadow
    Masters:      Howard Shore - Helm's deep
    Monks:        Howard Shore - May it be
    Prophets:     Howard Shore - The end of all things
    Simyarin:     Howard Shore - Lothlorien
    Vampires:     Howard Shore - Shelobs lair
    Vikings:      Howard Shore - The ride of the rohhirrim

